    producer: Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations
    title: 'Production: Production Indices'
    description: |-
      The FAO indices of agricultural production show the relative level of the aggregate volume of agricultural production for each year in comparison with the base period 2014-2016. Indices for meat production are computed based on data on production from indigenous animals.
    citation_full: 'Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations – Production: Production Indices (2026).'
